Package: ecosamp
Title: EcoSamp environmental sample designing algorithm
Version: 0.0.1.0000
Authors@R: 
    person("Xiuhan", "Zhang", 
    email = "xiuhan.zhang17@imperial.ac.uk", 
    role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    comment = c(ORCID = "0009-0001-2547-6801")
    )
Description: ecosamp provides methods for generating sample designs in environmental surveying across habitat types. The package allows customisable specification for different field sampling needs, including sampling habitat-treatment combinations; minimum number of sample points in each type of habitat/combination; minimum distance between sample points; minimum and/or maximum distances from roads, waters and habitat edges; maximum slope angle, etc. The package also allows both random sampling and maximum-distance sampling to accommodate different field research needs.
